sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant PR as Pull request
    participant M as main
    participant D as deploy (tf-apply-qa@)
    participant A as cmdb-aggregate
    participant O as cmdb-observed
    participant P as cmdb-publish
    participant R as release cmdb-latest
    PR->>PR: cmdb generate + check (sin nube)
    PR->>PR: G1: contrato · salidas sensibles<br/>comentario: radio de impacto
    PR->>M: merge con la mitad declarada
    M->>D: push a main
    loop cada stack cambiado
        D->>D: tofu apply
        D->>D: tofu show -json · tofu output -json<br/>descarta sensitive · > 1 KiB → sha256
        D-->>A: artifact observed/<id>.json
    end
    Note over A: concurrency: cmdb-write
    A->>O: commit con el runId · push (rebase y reintento)
    Note over O: push a esta rama no dispara deploy
    A->>P: needs
    P->>M: lee la mitad declarada
    P->>O: lee la mitad observada
    P->>R: index.json · graph.jsonld
